# Agent runtime artifacts (OpenClaw persona/memory seeds — not app code).
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: unanchored, these also matched same-named
# paths at any depth (src/memory/, src/SOUL.md), which would hide real source
# files from git silently. None of these artifacts exist here any more; the
# patterns are kept only so a future in-repo agent workspace stays out of git.
/SOUL.md
/IDENTITY.md
/USER.md
/memory/

# Tool/generated artifacts
.superpowers/
output/

# ClawMate runtime data (cache, feedback, sessions) — keep locally, not committed
.clawmate/

# Generated skill (skill_workshop auto-capture) — keep out of the repo
skills/openclaw-workspace-artifacts/
